# Contexto compartido de API, web y móvil: solo fuentes necesarias.
**
!infra/
!infra/**
!api/
!api/**
!pipeline/
!pipeline/**
!ai/
!ai/**
!web/
!web/**
!packages/
!packages/contracts/
!packages/contracts/**
!apps/
!apps/mobile/
!apps/mobile/package.json
!apps/mobile/package-lock.json
!apps/mobile/index.html
!apps/mobile/vite.config.js
!apps/mobile/astryx-themes.js
!apps/mobile/src/
!apps/mobile/src/**
!apps/mobile/public/
!apps/mobile/public/**

# Excluir dependencias, compilaciones y archivos locales de las fuentes.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/build
**/.cache
**/.vite
**/.vitest
**/_tpl
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.DS_Store
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.jks
**/*.keystore
